{"about":["Just Shapes & Beats is a chaotic co-op musical bullet-hell based on three simple things: avoid Shapes, move to the kick-ass Beats, and die, repeatedly.","It's a new spin on the SHMUP genre, adding a layer of cooperation that's at the core of the game: because everything is better with friends. Play alone or with up to four players, local or online, through the game's Story Mode or Challenge Runs."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0060/CUSA10349_00/FREE_CONTENTAXYhCbPbGc7fvfCtS1LE/mDmWBdKH_PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT1_176470.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0060/CUSA10349_00/FREE_CONTENTAXYhCbPbGc7fvfCtS1LE/mDmWBdKH_PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT1_176470.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0060/CUSA10349_00/FREE_CONTENTD8Lhu23Z0BDPtIkGvEHg/BPmQDczB_PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT2_176470.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0060/CUSA10349_00/FREE_CONTENTD8Lhu23Z0BDPtIkGvEHg/BPmQDczB_PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT2_176470.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0060/CUSA10349_00/FREE_CONTENT3CMCp3R311Ncmzk88TmS/lMddVkQW_PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT3_176470.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0060/CUSA10349_00/FREE_CONTENT3CMCp3R311Ncmzk88TmS/lMddVkQW_PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT3_176470.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"}],"summary":""}